# test/

Test suite using BATS (Bash Automated Testing System). Tests core dispatcher logic, target resolution, primitives, and the five cdsync commands. Includes fixtures and helper functions for integration testing.

## Files
- `cdsync.bats` -- BATS test suite for dispatcher, target resolution, primitives, and five main commands; includes setup/teardown fixtures and assertion helpers
